			"Message": "fix(Worker): Update telemetry app identifier and clean formatting\n\nReplace the telemetry `app` property value from \"land-editor\" to \"fiddee\" in `Source/Telemetry/Bridge.ts` to align with the current project tracking configuration. Additionally, remove a non-breaking space character (`\\u2009`) from the \"Funding & Acknowledgements\" header in `README.md` to ensure consistent ASCII-compatible whitespace.\n\nThese adjustments ensure accurate event attribution in analytics and maintain formatting standards across documentation.",
