			"Message": "chore(Worker): Update documentation links to PlayForm.Cloud domain\n\nReplace all instances of the Editor.Land domain with Land.PlayForm.Cloud in the Worker component's README.md. This includes the primary project logo links, documentation references (Worker Documentation and Architecture Overview), and the maintainer contact email address.\n\nThis aligns the landing page and documentation entry points with the new hosting infrastructure while preserving the existing structure of the README.",
